36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We now start the second test
of the Chunin Exam!</font>

39
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look for the brats!</font>

40
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those three, right?</font>

41
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go!</font>

42
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! First we search for that thing.
Can you do it, Hinata?</font>

43
00:02:03,850 --> 00:02:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

44
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slow down, Lee! We just started.</font>

45
00:02:10,230 --> 00:02:12,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know. But...</font>

46
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:15,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stay still!</font>

47
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows what kind of
powerful foe is waiting for us?!</font>

48
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you already understand,
we have only one target!</font>

49
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It sounds like they've already started.</font>

50
00:02:32,290 --> 00:02:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? That was someone's
scream just now, right?</font>

51
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm kinda getting nervous.</font>

52
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It was nothing, Sakura-chan.</font>

53
00:02:49,390 --> 00:02:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I have to pee.</font>

54
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You... Fool!</font>

55
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing in front of a lady!</font>

56
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to the grass!</font>

57
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:05,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Eat or be Eaten!</font>

58
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:05,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Naruto Becomes Bait</font>

59
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...! Oh...!</font>

60
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ahhh... that was a lot!</font>

61
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Feels much better!</font>

62
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon Naruto! I told you not to say
things like that in front of a lady...!</font>

63
00:03:29,230 --> 00:03:29,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

64
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke-kun...</font>

65
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what,
you don't have to go that far.</font>

66
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:42,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What was that for?</font>

67
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the real Naruto?!</font>

68
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

69
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what the hell
you're talking about!</font>

70
00:03:50,290 --> 00:03:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to the scratch
you got earlier from the Proctor?!</font>

71
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... your Shuriken holster
is on your left leg.</font>

72
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy's right-handed.</font>

73
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're worse at transformation
than Naruto, you phony!</font>

74
00:04:07,890 --> 00:04:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlucky me! In that case...</font>

75
00:04:12,690 --> 00:04:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one of you got the scroll?!</font>

76
00:04:15,310 --> 00:04:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since things have come to this,
I'll resort to force!</font>

77
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style:
Phoenix Flower Jutsu!</font>

78
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:30,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Sasuke!</font>

79
00:04:30,450 --> 00:04:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got to be kidding, useless.</font>

80
00:04:33,210 --> 00:04:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

81
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I caught you off guard! Lucky!</font>

82
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Paper Bomb...!</font>

83
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is lucky!</font>

84
00:04:47,890 --> 00:04:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you if you move!
Calmly hand over the scroll!</font>

85
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

86
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

87
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:04,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You're always late Naruto!</font>

88
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:09,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Absorption with my Chakra.</font>

89
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

90
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't just stand there, Sakura!</font>

91
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:29,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No guarantee this guy's alone!</font>

92
00:05:30,050 --> 00:05:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?!</font>

93
00:05:30,930 --> 00:05:32,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you let your guard down
you'll really get killed...</font>

94
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unlucky! I came on my own
to conceal my presence,</font>

95
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but that became my enemy...</font>

96
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got away, huh...?</font>

97
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's an instance that
we become separated,</font>

98
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't trust him if he looks
like your teammate.</font>

99
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like now there's a possibility</font>

100
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that an enemy will transform
to get close to us!</font>

101
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah.
— So what do we do?</font>

102
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll decide on a password.</font>

103
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:12,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Password?</font>

104
00:06:12,810 --> 00:06:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, if the password is incorrect,
no matter what he looks like...</font>

105
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:20,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">presume he is an enemy!</font>

106
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll only say it once, so listen closely.</font>

107
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You ask,
Ninja song, "Ninja Chance."</font>

108
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the answer is this:</font>

109
00:06:30,910 --> 00:06:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The chance to sneak up when a large
number of enemies are making a scene.</font>

110
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:36,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The quiet place has no secret hideout.</font>

111
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"It is important for a Shinobi
to know the right time.</font>

112
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The time when an enemy is tired
and drops his guard."</font>

113
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it.</font>

114
00:06:45,170 --> 00:06:46,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

115
00:06:47,970 --> 00:06:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could you say it again?</font>

116
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

117
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you I'd only say it once.</font>

118
00:06:53,890 --> 00:06:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that you couldn't memorize it?</font>

119
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You fool!
— Huh?!</font>

120
00:06:59,020 --> 00:07:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it right away!</font>

121
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:03,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I memorized it perfectly!</font>

122
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought just in case,
I'd listen one more time...</font>

123
00:07:08,650 --> 00:07:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll carry the scroll!</font>

124
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait Sasuke.</font>

125
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

126
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

127
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A new enemy?!</font>

128
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:41,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys go play around ...</font>

129
00:07:42,810 --> 00:07:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go alone...</font>

130
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

131
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

132
00:08:00,370 --> 00:08:01,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't come closer!</font>

133
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First the password...</font>

134
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja song, "Ninja Chance"!</font>

135
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:06,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah! Umm...</font>

136
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The chance to sneak up where a large
number of enemies are making a scene.</font>

137
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:12,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The quiet place has no secret hideout.</font>

138
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is important for a Shinobi
to know the right time.</font>

139
00:08:15,930 --> 00:08:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time when an enemy is tired
and drops his guard.</font>

140
00:08:18,850 --> 00:08:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good.</font>

141
00:08:19,930 --> 00:08:21,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow!</font>

142
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:23,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey everyone, are you okay?</font>

143
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:25,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, wait!</font>

144
00:08:26,150 --> 00:08:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The password...</font>

145
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

146
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:31,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The chance to sneak up where a large
number of enemies are making a scene.</font>

147
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The quiet place has no
secret hideout.</font>

148
00:08:34,990 --> 00:08:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is important for a Shinobi
to know the right time.</font>

149
00:08:38,370 --> 00:08:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time when an enemy
is tired and drops his guard.</font>

150
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Huh?!</font>

151
00:08:47,250 --> 00:08:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

152
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's someone who
can dodge my attack, huh?</font>

153
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying, Sasuke-kun?</font>

154
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:57,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto just said
the password properly.</font>

155
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was able to say it,
that's the problem!</font>

156
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— Wha...?</font>

157
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really think that guy can
remember a password that long?</font>

158
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

159
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we asked the normal Naruto
what the password is,</font>

160
00:09:11,690 --> 00:09:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what do you think he'd say?</font>

161
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Sorry. I've forgotten it."</font>

162
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, his movements when
he avoided my attack...</font>

163
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was clearly different
from Naruto's!</font>

164
00:09:26,290 --> 00:09:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show your true self already,
fake one!</font>

165
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how it is, huh...</font>

166
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you knew he would forget it,</font>

167
00:09:49,730 --> 00:09:53,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why didn't you make
the password shorter?</font>

168
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew that you were
underground</font>

169
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">eavesdropping on
our conversation.</font>

170
00:10:00,410 --> 00:10:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I chose that password on purpose.</font>

171
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh really. So you're not tired
or letting your guard down.</font>

172
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:14,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will be more fun than I thought.</font>

173
00:10:17,930 --> 00:10:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person's... too creepy!</font>

174
00:10:21,430 --> 00:10:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And where's Naruto?</font>

175
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

176
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow!</font>

177
00:10:34,190 --> 00:10:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And heave!</font>

178
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:41,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Where are Sakura-chan
and that Sasuke?</font>

179
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:47,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Huge!</font>

180
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the first time I've seen...
a snake this huge!</font>

181
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:03,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind?!</font>

182
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Tail!</font>

183
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want our Earth Scroll,
don't you?</font>

184
00:11:27,830 --> 00:11:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">‘Cause you have the Heaven Scroll.</font>

185
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's begin...</font>

186
00:11:50,230 --> 00:11:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the battle for the Scrolls.</font>

187
00:11:55,650 --> 00:11:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Life or Death!</font>

188
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu?!</font>

189
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it.</font>

190
00:12:38,770 --> 00:12:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is simply
a thirst for blood.</font>

191
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

192
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just looking at her eyes
made me think of death.</font>

193
00:12:52,410 --> 00:12:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is this... woman?!</font>

194
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:00,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sa... Sakura...?</font>

195
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good.</font>

196
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have no choice but to flee here.</font>

197
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:18,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unless we do, the only thing
waiting for us is...</font>

198
00:13:21,070 --> 00:13:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Death!</font>

199
00:13:24,190 --> 00:13:26,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me out! Hey!</font>

200
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Spit... me... out!</font>

201
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:36,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!
It's not going to work.</font>

202
00:13:37,460 --> 00:13:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something else...</font>

203
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

204
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rice ball I took for lunch!</font>

205
00:13:46,590 --> 00:13:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

206
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dissolving!</font>

207
00:13:57,060 --> 00:14:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be digested just like
that rice ball eventually...</font>

208
00:14:03,650 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No!</font>

209
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me out! Let me... out!</font>

210
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't move already...?</font>

211
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's going to kill me!</font>

212
00:14:22,170 --> 00:14:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move... move... move...!</font>

213
00:14:25,050 --> 00:14:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

214
00:14:28,260 --> 00:14:30,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move! Move!</font>

215
00:14:32,010 --> 00:14:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

216
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's just a little...
Move!</font>

217
00:14:48,950 --> 00:14:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you intend to do... with that?</font>

218
00:14:57,290 --> 00:14:58,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't move!</font>

219
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.
I'll end this in a second.</font>

220
00:15:06,210 --> 00:15:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't even have
the time to feel pain.</font>

221
00:15:22,190 --> 00:15:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted you to entertain me more.</font>

222
00:15:26,780 --> 00:15:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad.</font>

223
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:46,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am... I going to die here?</font>

224
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei</font>

225
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man Hokage...</font>

226
00:16:00,230 --> 00:16:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru...</font>

227
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei.</font>

228
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan.</font>

229
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke.</font>

230
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lot happened between him and me.</font>

231
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:25,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we always squabbled,</font>

232
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we cooperated and saved Kakashi-sensei
in that encounter with Zabuza.</font>

233
00:16:33,130 --> 00:16:35,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During our Chakra training in the forest,</font>

234
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we competed against each other and
practiced climbing up trees.</font>

235
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it! I haven't...</font>

236
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">settled things with him yet!</font>

237
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— More rice!
— More rice!</font>

238
00:16:58,490 --> 00:17:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this creature doesn't want to
spit me out ...</font>

239
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make it to do so at any cost!</font>

240
00:17:19,850 --> 00:17:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

241
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

242
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wounded himself
at the last moment...</font>

243
00:17:54,090 --> 00:17:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move. Move. Move.
Move...!</font>

244
00:18:03,890 --> 00:18:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

245
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wiped out the fear with pain.</font>

246
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected,
he's not the average prey.</font>

247
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

248
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... am a Shinobi who
will become Hokage!</font>

249
00:18:42,430 --> 00:18:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't put up with being
snake dung in this place!</font>

250
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun.</font>

251
00:18:57,990 --> 00:18:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

252
00:19:00,990 --> 00:19:04,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we don't flee in a hurry,
we'll be discovered here, too.</font>

253
00:19:05,910 --> 00:19:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do we flee...?</font>

254
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How should we escape...?</font>

255
00:19:09,830 --> 00:19:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen Sasuke-kun...</font>

256
00:19:14,090 --> 00:19:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so worked up.</font>

257
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:23,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, a snake!</font>

258
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot! I was too shaken up
to notice the snake!</font>

259
00:19:43,990 --> 00:19:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't come near me!</font>

260
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lower your guard,
not even for a moment...</font>

261
00:20:16,730 --> 00:20:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A prey must always stay tense
and try to flee desperately...</font>

262
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before a predator.</font>

263
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ahh... Huh?!</font>

264
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, Sasuke..</font>

265
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

266
00:20:58,110 --> 00:21:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The password... I forgot it!</font>

267
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

268
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

269
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

270
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

271
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

272
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

274
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

275
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

276
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

277
00:21:42,950 --> 00:21:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

278
00:21:42,950 --> 00:21:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

279
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

280
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

281
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

282
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

283
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

284
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

285
00:22:05,170 --> 00:22:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

286
00:22:05,170 --> 00:22:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you forget what happiness is</font></b></font></font>

287
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mina utae</font></b></font></font>

288
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">just sing</font></b></font></font>

289
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hikari ga umare yami ga umare ta</font></b></font></font>

